// The world, then a marker on everything selected, then the stage handed back.
// The markers are drawn after the whole world rather than per entity, so a
// selected thing behind an unselected one still shows -- which is the point of a
// marker.
ed_pdone(int was) {
  ed_marks(0);
  ed_pset(0, 0, was);
} return void;
given ed_t_boot stdin "" (999):(999) then calls ed_marks:(0)
given ed_t_boot stdin "" (999):(999) then calls ed_pset:(0, 0, 999)
